flowchart TD
    UserStart([User Lupa Password]) --> OpenForm[Buka Halaman /forgot-password]
    OpenForm --> InputForm[Input Username Terdaftar & Keterangan Kontak]
    InputForm --> CheckUser{Username Valid?}
    CheckUser -->|Tidak Ada| ErrorMsg[Error: Username tidak terdaftar]
    CheckUser -->|Ada| CheckPending{Sudah ada permintaan pending?}
    CheckPending -->|Sudah Ada| NoticeSent[Redirect /forgot-password/sent: Mohon tunggu admin]
    CheckPending -->|Belum Ada| SaveRequest[Simpan ke password_requests: status 'pending']
    SaveRequest --> ConfirmSent[Redirect /forgot-password/sent: Sukses Terkirim]
    
    ConfirmSent --> AdminSide[Admin Login ke /admin/password-request]
    AdminSide --> ViewReq[Lihat Daftar Permintaan Pending]
    ViewReq --> AdminDecision{Keputusan Admin}
    AdminDecision -->|Reset Password| ResetPass[Input Password Baru & Submit Reset]
    ResetPass --> UpdateUser[Update user.password & set status 'selesai']
    UpdateUser --> NotifyUser[Admin Konfirmasi ke User via WhatsApp]
    AdminDecision -->|Tolak Permintaan| RejectPass[Set status 'ditolak' & resolved_by]
    RejectPass --> EndReject([Permintaan Ditolak])
    NotifyUser --> EndDone([Selesai - User Login dengan Password Baru])
